/-- [DIR], §6.2 (cited from [BIM23, Lemma 2.2]): $G^1_\beta[L_\beta](x,y)\ge0$ for all
$0\le x\le y\le\frac12$ (for $\beta\in[\frac12,1]$).

**Discrepancy with the paper.** Paper: cited, no proof. Lean: proved following the proof of
